{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokobos 2 is a modern twist on the classic block-pushing formula, inspired by Greek tragedies. You must load all the vases into your cart, but the cart moves too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.poster.avif?t=1757687975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.webm?t=1757687975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.mp4?t=1757687975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience small and handcrafted puzzles focused on &quot;aha!&quot; moments with interesting interactions and clever solutions. Some objects can be pushed into water to create a bridge, while others float and drift away with the current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both Sokoban newcomers and veterans alike! Sokobos 2 offers a unique twist and smooth learning curve that welcomes newcomers but respects their problem-solving later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Ancient Greece. You have upset the Gods, and collecting the vases for eternity is your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brief Summary</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cart isn't just a container, it's part of the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond vases and the cart, interact with gates, pressure plates, water mechanics, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals keeping the focus on puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaches new interactions clearly but trusts your problem-solving skills afterward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story inspired by Greek tragedies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422180?t=1757687975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422180?t=1757687975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/06523a6158fccfb28f7952531cb3595bc8b2979f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757687975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/06523a6158fccfb28f7952531cb3595bc8b2979f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757687975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3625810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokobos 2 is a modern twist on the classic block-pushing formula, inspired by Greek tragedies. You must load all the vases into your cart, but the cart moves too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.poster.avif?t=1757687975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.webm?t=1757687975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.mp4?t=1757687975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience small and handcrafted puzzles focused on &quot;aha!&quot; moments with interesting interactions and clever solutions. Some objects can be pushed into water to create a bridge, while others float and drift away with the current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both Sokoban newcomers and veterans alike! Sokobos 2 offers a unique twist and smooth learning curve that welcomes newcomers but respects their problem-solving later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Ancient Greece. You have upset the Gods, and collecting the vases for eternity is your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brief Summary</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cart isn't just a container, it's part of the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond vases and the cart, interact with gates, pressure plates, water mechanics, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals keeping the focus on puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaches new interactions clearly but trusts your problem-solving skills afterward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story inspired by Greek tragedies</p></li></ul>","developers":["Martin Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/header.jpg?t=1757